WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.667
Parsing and formatting move in opposite directions
Parsing starts with

00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:11.578
text and creates a typed date or timestamp That
typed value can be sorted

00:00:11.736 --> 00:00:17.374
compared grouped and used in arithmetic Formatting
starts with

00:00:17.401 --> 00:00:22.943
a typed temporal value and creates text for human
presentation For

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.443
analytics parse early and format late
